{"5073050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "POWDR", "steam_appid": 5073050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GPU-ACCELERATED PARTICLE SANDBOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a deeply interactive world of powders, liquids, gases, heat, pressure, combustion, and destruction. Simulate up to <strong>1 MILLION PARTICLES</strong> <i>(performance dependent on varying computer hardware)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMULATE DYNAMIC FLUIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flood the world with water, oil, acid, nitro, molten materials, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/77709430deb27f9882cbde6bae61e159.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/77709430deb27f9882cbde6bae61e159.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/77709430deb27f9882cbde6bae61e159.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD WORLDS ONE PARTICLE AT A TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour shifting landscapes of sand, soil, stone, snow, and other granular materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/1e645b59795aa79a7894e56f6639bc05.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/1e645b59795aa79a7894e56f6639bc05.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/1e645b59795aa79a7894e56f6639bc05.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE DYNAMIC LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow forests from individual seeds and populate your world with autonomous stickmen. They explore the environment, react to danger, gather resources, and work together to construct procedural buildings and settlements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/be07b2c3a0a5c0b542b4d7b2a829b9ed.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/be07b2c3a0a5c0b542b4d7b2a829b9ed.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/be07b2c3a0a5c0b542b4d7b2a829b9ed.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, BURN, AND DESTROY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the limits with fire, volatile materials, and environmental forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/8b635588daf9d40579c80ff1af686349.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/8b635588daf9d40579c80ff1af686349.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/8b635588daf9d40579c80ff1af686349.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH TOTAL DESTRUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch explosive and kinetic missiles, call down orbital beams, detonate nuclear weapons, or create a growing black hole that tears the surrounding world apart.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/93ccd7145bf04e29d341cfc1001e3f6c.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/93ccd7145bf04e29d341cfc1001e3f6c.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/93ccd7145bf04e29d341cfc1001e3f6c.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPU-accelerated simulation with a maximum of 1,000,000 active particles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocked framerate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 powders, liquids, gases, solids, molten materials, plasma, fire, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat, pressure, combustion, phase changes, and material reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic forces, vortices, attractors, and repulsors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autonomous stickmen with exploration and construction behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated houses, towers, wells, bridges, windmills, and other structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructive weapons including missiles, nuclear strikes, orbital beams, and black holes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing vegetation and reactive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-and-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene saving and loading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple simulation and performance settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GPU-ACCELERATED PARTICLE SANDBOX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a deeply interactive world of powders, liquids, gases, heat, pressure, combustion, and destruction. Simulate up to <strong>1 MILLION PARTICLES</strong> <i>(performance dependent on varying computer hardware)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMULATE DYNAMIC FLUIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flood the world with water, oil, acid, nitro, molten materials, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/77709430deb27f9882cbde6bae61e159.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/77709430deb27f9882cbde6bae61e159.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/77709430deb27f9882cbde6bae61e159.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD WORLDS ONE PARTICLE AT A TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour shifting landscapes of sand, soil, stone, snow, and other granular materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/1e645b59795aa79a7894e56f6639bc05.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/1e645b59795aa79a7894e56f6639bc05.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/1e645b59795aa79a7894e56f6639bc05.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE DYNAMIC LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow forests from individual seeds and populate your world with autonomous stickmen. They explore the environment, react to danger, gather resources, and work together to construct procedural buildings and settlements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/be07b2c3a0a5c0b542b4d7b2a829b9ed.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/be07b2c3a0a5c0b542b4d7b2a829b9ed.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/be07b2c3a0a5c0b542b4d7b2a829b9ed.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD, BURN, AND DESTROY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the limits with fire, volatile materials, and environmental forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/8b635588daf9d40579c80ff1af686349.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/8b635588daf9d40579c80ff1af686349.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/8b635588daf9d40579c80ff1af686349.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH TOTAL DESTRUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch explosive and kinetic missiles, call down orbital beams, detonate nuclear weapons, or create a growing black hole that tears the surrounding world apart.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/93ccd7145bf04e29d341cfc1001e3f6c.poster.avif?t=1788361263\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/93ccd7145bf04e29d341cfc1001e3f6c.webm?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/extras/93ccd7145bf04e29d341cfc1001e3f6c.mp4?t=1788361263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPU-accelerated simulation with a maximum of 1,000,000 active particles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocked framerate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 powders, liquids, gases, solids, molten materials, plasma, fire, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat, pressure, combustion, phase changes, and material reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic forces, vortices, attractors, and repulsors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autonomous stickmen with exploration and construction behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated houses, towers, wells, bridges, windmills, and other structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructive weapons including missiles, nuclear strikes, orbital beams, and black holes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing vegetation and reactive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-and-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene saving and loading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple simulation and performance settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "POWDR is a high performance interactive particle sandbox featuring realistic fluids, sands, solids, interactions, and more! Every pixel is simulated. Every material interacts. Every experiment can become a catastrophe.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/aed0176806c371bdce05660f2534f2f4800351de/header.jpg?t=1788361263", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/2ea49e27d0760578ec0316121d63a6e1439df728/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788361263", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5073050/2ea49e27d0760578ec0316121d63a6e1439df728/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788361263", "website": "https://subliminalsoft.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Vista, 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X11 Compatible Card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> N/A</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "COPYRIGHT © 2026 SUBLIMINAL SOFTWARE LLC<br />\r\nALL RIGHTS RESERVED", "developers": ["SUBLI